cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DataLab in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "DataLab: an open-source platform for signal and image processing"
abstract: >-
  DataLab is an open-source platform for scientific and technical data
  processing and visualization, handling 1D signals and 2D images in a single
  workspace. It is extensible with Python plugins and macros, and can be
  remotely controlled from Jupyter, Spyder or any IDE.
authors:
  - family-names: Raybaut
    given-names: Pierre
    email: p.raybaut@codra.fr
  - name: "DataLab Platform Developers"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/DataLab-Platform/DataLab"
url: "https://datalab-platform.com/"
keywords:
  - signal processing
  - image processing
  - data analysis
  - scientific software
  - visualization
  - Python
  - Qt
